#!/bin/bash -l
# K114: per-block forward/backward time and peak memory, Pairformer (Stage 0 config, +/- triangle
# attention) vs transformer 50m, B 8/32 x N 100/150/256/512 (pbs/diag/pairformer_profile.py).
#
#   qsub -q debug -l select=1 -l walltime=00:45:00 -A UIC-HPC -l filesystems=home:flare \
#        -v REPO_DIR=$PWD pbs/diag/pairformer_profile.pbs
#
# One tile. Output: results/raw/diag/pairformer_profile/<jobid>.json (+ .log). Extra script
# arguments (e.g. --models transformer --peaks 100,150) can be passed with -v PROFILE_ARGS=...

#PBS -N msdelta-k114prof
#PBS -A UIC-HPC
#PBS -l filesystems=home:flare
#PBS -j oe
#PBS -o pbs/logs/

set -uo pipefail
REPO_DIR=${REPO_DIR:-${PBS_O_WORKDIR:-$PWD}}
cd "$REPO_DIR"

set +u
source "${REPO_DIR:-${PBS_O_WORKDIR:-$PWD}}/pbs/lib/load_frameworks.sh"
set -u
export ONEAPI_DEVICE_SELECTOR=level_zero:gpu
export ZE_FLAT_DEVICE_HIERARCHY=FLAT
export ZE_AFFINITY_MASK=0
export OMP_NUM_THREADS=${OMP_NUM_THREADS:-8}
export PYTHONPATH=$REPO_DIR${PYTHONPATH:+:$PYTHONPATH}
# Run from a frozen copy of the code (pbs/lib/code_snapshot.sh).
source "$REPO_DIR/pbs/lib/code_snapshot.sh"
PY="$REPO_DIR/.venv/bin/python"
JOB=${PBS_JOBID%%.*}; JOB=${JOB:-local}
O=results/raw/diag/pairformer_profile; mkdir -p "$O"

echo "=== $(date -Is) K114 pairformer profile on $(hostname), job $JOB"
# configs/ is read from the checkout (cwd), as for every job; the snapshot has the code.
# shellcheck disable=SC2086
"$PY" "$MSDELTA_CODE_DIR"/pbs/diag/pairformer_profile.py --out "$O/$JOB.json" \
    ${PROFILE_ARGS:-} 2>&1 | tee "$O/$JOB.log"
rc=${PIPESTATUS[0]}
echo "=== $(date -Is) done (rc=$rc)"
exit $rc
